    "The app asks fractal8.eu for the number of the newest version — it sends nothing else. A new version installs only when you click “Install”.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app asks fractal8.eu for the number of the newest version — it sends nothing else. A new version installs only when you click “Install”."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Program pyta stronę fractal8.eu o numer najnowszej wersji — nic więcej nie wysyła. Nowa wersja instaluje się dopiero, gdy klikniesz „Zainstaluj”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app downloads the new version, checks it, replaces itself and restarts. Your layout and settings stay.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app downloads the new version, checks it, replaces itself and restarts. Your layout and settings stay."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Program pobierze nową wersję, sprawdzi ją, podmieni się i uruchomi ponownie. Układ i ustawienia zostają."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app is busy — click again in a moment.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app is busy — click again in a moment."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Program jest zajęty — kliknij ponownie za chwilę."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app sits where it cannot be overwritten (e.g. opened straight from Downloads). Move it to the Applications folder or download the new version manually.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app sits where it cannot be overwritten (e.g. opened straight from Downloads). Move it to the Applications folder or download the new version manually."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Program stoi w miejscu, którego nie da się nadpisać (np. otwarty prosto z Pobranych). Przenieś go do katalogu Aplikacje albo pobierz nową wersję ręcznie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The layout covers “All apps” and “System utilities”, each with its own order — and you can drag icons from one to the other. The “recent” sections keep their own order.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The layout covers “All apps” and “System utilities”, each with its own order — and you can drag icons from one to the other. The “recent” sections keep their own order."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Układ obejmuje „Wszystkie programy” i „Narzędzia systemowe”, każda sekcja ma własną kolejność — a ikony przeciąga się z jednej do drugiej. Sekcje „ostatnie” zachowują swoją kolejność."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new version is installed, but the restart failed. Quit and reopen the app manually.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The new version is installed, but the restart failed. Quit and reopen the app manually."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nowa wersja jest zainstalowana, ale restart się nie udał. Zamknij i otwórz program ręcznie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The package address leads outside fractal8.eu — the app will not download it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The package address leads outside fractal8.eu — the app will not download it."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adres paczki prowadzi poza serwer fractal8.eu — program jej nie pobierze."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The window no longer stretches sideways by dragging its edge — the width is set here and changes right away. Height still follows the edge.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The window no longer stretches sideways by dragging its edge — the width is set here and changes right away. Height still follows the edge."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Okna nie rozciąga się już wszerz ciągnięciem za krawędź — szerokość ustawia się tutaj i wchodzi od razu. Wysokość dalej idzie za krawędzią."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The window shows up in the middle of the screen the pointer is on, wherever it was dragged last time. Its size is still remembered.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The window shows up in the middle of the screen the pointer is on, wherever it was dragged last time. Its size is still remembered."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Okno wychodzi na środku ekranu, na którym stoi kursor — niezależnie od tego, dokąd zostało ostatnio przesunięte. Rozmiar dalej jest pamiętany."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This build is ad-hoc signed: every rebuild voids the Accessibility permission, even though the switch stays on. Remove AppGrid from the list and add it again after each build.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This build is ad-hoc signed: every rebuild voids the Accessibility permission, even though the switch stays on. Remove AppGrid from the list and add it again after each build."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta wersja jest podpisana ad-hoc: każde przebudowanie unieważnia zgodę na Dostępność, mimo że przełącznik zostaje włączony. Po każdym buildzie usuń AppGrida z listy i dodaj go ponownie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This combination is taken by another app — pick a different one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This combination is taken by another app — pick a different one."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tę kombinację zajmuje inny program — wybierz inną."
          }
        }
      }
